* Using a basic attack {{tip|breaks stealth|breaks the stealth}} at the start of the attack windup.
** Unlike other champions that ''break the stealth'' at the start of attack windup, '''Rengar''' may automatically start attacking a nearby target if the player's "Auto Attack" setting is turned on. [https://github.com/ArdaSenyurek/Rengar-Bugs/issues/114] {{bug|2|Started on V26.01}}|affectedEffects=Rengar R|estimatedPatchOrigin=V26.01|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1776029756|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Rengar/Thrill of the Hunt
