* The ability applies a mark on the target at the start of {{tip|attack windup}} that is successively consumed when the basic attack hits to apply the effect.
** If the attack is prevented or blocked (e.g. by {{tip|knockdown|knocking down}} '''Rengar''' when {{ai|Unseen Predator|Rengar|leaping}}) then the effect will not be applied.
*** The mark will however still linger for a very short period after that, allowing '''Rengar''' to consume it with a quick basic attack. [https://github.com/ArdaSenyurek/Rengar-Bugs/issues/108]
